    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "### Help & Overview - Azure Tenant Certificate Monitoring\r\n\r\nThis workbook queries Azure Resource Graph (ARG) in real time across all selected subscriptions in your tenant.\r\n\r\n#### Covered Certificate Asset Types:\r\n1. **App Service Certificates (`microsoft.web/certificates`)**: Custom SSL certificates uploaded or managed for App Services.\r\n2. **App Service Certificate Orders (`microsoft.web/certificateorders`)**: Managed domain certificate orders through Azure, with auto-renew tracking.\r\n3. **Web Apps & Custom Domain SSL Bindings (`microsoft.web/sites`)**: Maps App Service & Function App custom hostnames to their bound certificates, thumbprints, and live expiration dates.\r\n4. **Application Gateways (`microsoft.network/applicationgateways`)**: SSL termination certificates, identifying whether they use **Azure Key Vault with auto-rotation** or **manually uploaded blobs**.\r\n5. **API Management (`microsoft.apimanagement/service`)**: Custom domain endpoint certificates (Gateway, Portal, Management) and Key Vault integrations.\r\n6. **Azure Front Door & CDN (`microsoft.cdn/profiles/customdomains`)**: Edge TLS configurations and custom domain validation status.\r\n7. **Azure Key Vaults (`microsoft.keyvault/vaults`)**: Posture review (Soft Delete, Purge Protection) and Diagnostic Logging recommendations.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> Azure Resource Graph requires Reader role on target subscriptions to read resource metadata.",
        "style": "info"
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "Help",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Yes"
      },
      "name": "text - Help Documentation"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "### Change Log\r\n\r\n| Version | Date | Description |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| **v1.0.0** | Initial Release | Initial release of full tenant Azure Certificate Expiry Workbook: App Services, Certificate Orders, Web App SSL bindings, Application Gateways, APIM, Front Door, and Key Vault integration. |",
        "style": "upsell"
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "Help",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Change Log"
      },
      "name": "text - Change Log"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.web/certificates'\r\n| extend ExpirationDate = todatetime(properties.expirationDate)\r\n| extend DaysRemaining = datetime_diff('day', ExpirationDate, now())\r\n| summarize\r\n    TotalCertificates = count(),\r\n    Expired = countif(DaysRemaining < 0),\r\n    Critical30Days = countif(DaysRemaining >= 0 and DaysRemaining <= 30),\r\n    Warning60Days = countif(DaysRemaining > 30 and DaysRemaining <= 60),\r\n    Attention90Days = countif(DaysRemaining > 60 and DaysRemaining <= 90),\r\n    Healthy = countif(DaysRemaining > 90)\r\n| extend Dummy = 1\r\n| project-away Dummy",
        "size": 4,
        "title": "Certificate Health Overview (Tenant-Wide)",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "{Subscriptions}"
        ],
        "visualization": "tiles",
        "tileSettings": {
          "showBorder": true,
          "titleContent": {
            "columnMatch": "TotalCertificates",
            "formatter": 1
          },
          "leftContent": {
            "columnMatch": "TotalCertificates",
            "formatter": 12,
            "formatOptions": {
              "palette": "auto"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "query - Top KPI Metrics"
    },
