            "content": {
              "json": "### Key Vaults & Centralized Certificate Lifecycle Monitoring\r\nReview Key Vault security posture (Soft Delete, Purge Protection) across your tenant, and configure Azure Monitor Diagnostic Settings to ingest real-time certificate near-expiry alerts into Log Analytics."
